   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:9.0pt;margin-left:0in;line-height:33.0pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;color:#022851;text-transform:uppercase\">#MAPTIMEDAVIS &amp; DAVIS R USERS GROUP WORKSHOP: EARTH ENGINE &amp; R FOR PRESENTATION-QUALITY CONTEXTUAL MAPS<u></u><u></u></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Description: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">We will combine the power\r\n of Earth Engine with the user-friendliness of R to generate beautiful, presentation-quality contextual maps. The workshop will focus on Landsat imagery, but is generalizable to other remote sensing products. Creativity is encouraged! We will use Earth Engine\r\n to access, filter, and crop data for download, and then use R to wrangle our dataset and generate beautiful, high-resolution plots.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Location: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Online via Zoom. Please register\r\n for the link to participate.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Registration: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"><a href=\"https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/MaptimeDavisWorkshopEarth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://registration.genomecenter.ucdavis.edu/events/MaptimeDavisWorkshopEarth/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465303888000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0KbPS8t22O_X3YI9Q-YvNj\"><span style=\"color:#5da7ba;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Register\r\n Here</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Cost: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Free of charge<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Learning Objectives: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Attendees will learn\r\n how to access, filter, and download data using Google Earth Engine, and to process and plot raster datasets using a tidyverse approach in R.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Prerequisites: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">No experience necessary,\r\n but Earth Engine and R exposure are a bonus!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Software: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Attendees will need to have\r\n a Google Earth Engine account prior to attending the workshop (may take a few days to process a request for a new account), and have R installed. Attendees will also need to have the following R packages installed: tidyverse, raster, sf, rgdal, RStoolbox.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"><u></u> <u></u></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Presenter: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Christian John<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\"><u></u><u></u></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;color:#333333;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Presenter Bio: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Christian is a 4th-year\r\n PhD student in the Graduate Group in Ecology using novel remote sensing data to explore how snowmelt and plant growth drive bighorn sheep migration.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<hr size=\"3\" width=\"1484\" style=\"width:890.25pt\" noshade style=\"color:#333333\" align=\"center\">\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Whenever possible, #maptimeDavis Workshops will be recorded and posted on the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTooXK1RiSHNbWsmeqz0W6g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTooXK1RiSHNbWsmeqz0W6g&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465303888000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZlWR1-kFgM-ggvpBwP_gL\"><span style=\"color:#5da7ba;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">DataLab\r\n YouTube channel</span></a>. #maptimeDavis Studio will not be recorded to encourage open discussion. Weekly reminders will be sent on the <a href=\"https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lists.ucdavis.edu/sympa/info/geospatial&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465303888000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37Y9WgW-bwHu5yCQIXTe4g\"><span style=\"color:#5da7ba;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Geospatial\r\n Email List</span></a>.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;background:white;vertical-align:baseline;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;text-align:start;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">#maptimeDavis Workshops and Studio are a product of UC Davis DataLab’s <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/spatial-sciences/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465303888000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zsUlWKj_hLVMQvxmWjAwb\"><span style=\"color:#5da7ba;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">Spatial\r\n Sciences Research Cluster</span></a> and are supported by the contributions and participation of our community. Please send questions to Michele Tobias <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#5da7ba;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Geospatial Data Specialist<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">DataLab: Data Science &amp; Informatics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Data &amp; Digital Scholarship<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">370 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">ORCID: </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465303888000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tFm-hbeO0SJTayYT_3WFC\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">0000-0002-2954-8710</span></a>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
